{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7HHCEag9kueShRHEVma","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've drafted the summary below. Before you submit it, there are three problems in the facts that reviewers are likely to notice, and the draft depends on how you resolve them.\n\n1. **The $33,000-a-year gap.** The position costs $78,000 a year, but the foundation will pay at most $45,000. Reviewers will look for where the rest comes from. I left that source as a blank. Only say it's the county money if that's actually true. The $60,000 county contract probably already pays for your existing work.\n\n2. **The attorney leaving in June.** If this grant pays for the person who replaces them, you stay at two attorneys, not three. In that case, calling this a \"third attorney\" would mislead the foundation, and the claim about serving more tenants wouldn't hold up. If you have other money to replace the departing attorney, the draft works as written. If you don't, the request should be reframed as keeping your capacity from falling by half. That's honest and still a strong case, because without the hire you'd be turning away even more people. Tell me which situation you're in and I'll revise.\n\n3. **The county contract.** You said it's up for renewal in October, and it's now mid-November. Has it been renewed? Fill in the current status. Funders care whether your core funding is stable.\n\nOther choices I made:\n- **Number of extra tenants served:** I estimated about 80 more tenants a year. That's 163 cases split between two attorneys, so roughly 80 per attorney. Change it if you have a better number.\n- **The 58% figure:** I didn't say it's better than what tenants get without a lawyer, since you don't have that comparison. I also didn't add claims about what happens to families afterward, like whether they avoid homelessness, because you don't have data on that.\n- **Length:** The draft is about 260 words, which leaves some room for the blanks.\n\n<final_document>\n**Project Summary**\n\n[Clinic Name] requests $90,000 over two years ($45,000 per year) to add a third staff attorney to our eviction defense practice, expanding legal representation for low-income tenants facing eviction in [County].\n\n**The need.** In [year], 1,140 eviction cases were filed in [County]. Our two attorneys represented the tenant in 163 of them, about 14%. We turned away approximately 300 more tenants who sought our help because no attorney was available. Each of our attorneys currently carries about 80 open cases; we cannot serve more tenants without adding staff.\n\n**Our results.** In cases where we represented the tenant, 58% ended with the tenant remaining in the home or receiving at least 60 days to move. That time allows families to secure new housing on their own terms rather than under the pressure of an immediate lockout.\n\n**The project.** A third attorney will allow us to represent approximately [80] additional tenants per year, about [160] over the grant period, drawn directly from the households we currently turn away. The new attorney will [describe role, e.g., provide full representation from answer through trial or settlement and staff the eviction docket on (days)].\n\n**Budget and sustainability.** The position costs $78,000 per year, including benefits. Foundation funds will cover $45,000 annually; the remaining $33,000 per year will come from [source]. Our core operations are supported by a $60,000 annual contract with [County], [current renewal status]. [One sentence on how the position will be sustained after year two.]\n\n**Evaluation.** We will track tenants served, case outcomes, and the number of tenants turned away, and will report results to the Foundation [annually/semi-annually].\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5415,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5415},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6745a232-a69c-4920-ab01-8a4792ffc1a9","uuid":"c9144a42-53c2-4a90-b62e-213263279103","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:01:52.904Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7HHBvDeYVsUKfWdW9hr"}
